OL,3,GNEWSAStorm leaves homes without power
OL,4,Aand cars wrecked
OL,5,
OL,6,FStorm Boelo has uprooted trees which
OL,7,Fhave smashed into cars and left tens of
OL,8,Fthousands of people without powers as
OL,9,Fit blows across the North West.
OL,11,FSP Electricity North West said
OL,12,Fthousands of homes had been hit by
OL,13,Fpower cuts caused by strong gust of
OL,14,Fwinds, with more than 500 homes
OL,15,Faffected in Blackpool and 200 in Wigan
OL,16,Falone.
OL,18,FMore than 400 people had to be
OL,19,Fevacuated from a caravan park near
OL,20,FPreston, Lancashire, and a family day
OL,21,Frace meeting at Merseyside's Aintree
OL,22,Fracecourse has been cancelled.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
